  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading the layers",
      "items": [
        "Arrows between Markdown files show agent navigation, not executable calls.",
        "Router: hard-rule triggers, active work, craft activity and domain routes. Catalog contains all routed entries; archive holds shipped pointers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Project and privacy",
      "items": [
        "The engine lives in scripts/memory/. Its checkpoint refreshes optional project records.",
        "Project facts live in the project's own knowledge folder, under that folder's own rules. The engine can maintain configured indexes and logs.",
        "Install creates a memory git repo; a private remote must be configured separately. No remote is used in the demo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Sources and limits",
      "items": [
        "Source: templates, skills/memory-ladder/SKILL.md, engine/memory-index.mjs, engine/memory-checkpoint.mjs and README.md.",
        "The installer does not create a full brain. The tree shows the conventional brain layout, not an installed fixture."
      ]
    }
  ]
